---
title: "Queued ask submission"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: No stored ask
  s1: Access revoked, no stored ask
  s2: Ask inserted, transaction uncommitted
  s3: Ask and receipt committed
  s4: Ask retained, access revoked
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Partner access revoked
  s0 --> s2: Partner submits
  s2 --> s0: Receipt write fails
  s2 --> s3: Receipt commits
  s3 --> s4: Partner access revoked
